#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:5 f714766dd2814d8e882a92ef4c8fbc0b
msgid "Flip Mode"
msgstr "Flip 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:7 41b449f8be8841edb202ce84ae0843e3
msgid ""
"Vehicle will flip on its roll or pitch axis depending upon the pilot's roll "
"and pitch stick position in flight mode's which allow this "
"(ACRO/ALTHOLD/STABILIZE...and,of course, FLIP mode). Vehicle will increase "
"throttle rapidly as it starts to flip. Once the flip is completed, canceled,"
" or times out, the original flight mode the vehicle was in will be restored."
" The flip will end at the entry attitude."
msgstr ""
"在允许该操作的飞行模式（ACRO/ALTHOLD/STABILIZE……当然还有 FLIP "
"模式）中，飞行器会根据飞手横滚和俯仰摇杆的位置绕横滚或俯仰轴翻转。开始翻转时飞行器会迅速加大油门。翻转完成、取消或超时后，将恢复到进入前的原飞行模式。翻转会在进入时的姿态结束。"

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:9 691669fcc6f74fe7946282aa70c3e41b
msgid ""
"The vehicle will not flip again until the switch is brought low and back to "
"high, if on an :ref:`Auxiliary Switch <common-auxiliary-functions>`, or if "
"the mode channel switch is changed to another mode and back to FLIP."
msgstr ""
"若使用 :ref:`辅助开关 <common-auxiliary-"
"functions>`，需将开关拨低再拨回高位；若使用模式通道开关，则需切换到其他模式再切回 FLIP，飞行器才会再次翻转。"

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:11 5b3f96e191e74594a04fe5c3d318596a
msgid ""
"Give yourself at least 10m of altitude before trying flip for the first "
"time!"
msgstr "第一次尝试翻转前，请确保至少有 10m 的高度！"

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:14 8f4638d6bfdf49368cb9d5f83e67c721
#, fuzzy
msgid "Flip Mode Controls"
msgstr "Flip 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:15 ab8f0fcb744b49468aaa61c0a4896eec
msgid ""
"The mode may be entered either by an :ref:`Auxiliary Switch <common-"
"auxiliary-functions>`, or by changing flight mode to FLIP."
msgstr "可通过 :ref:`辅助开关 <common-auxiliary-functions>` 或将飞行模式切换为 FLIP 来进入该模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:17 3d41f9d4fe4f4da0b674d9c971c37b52
msgid ""
"The direction of the flip defaults to ROLL LEFT, but if the RC Pitch stick "
"is moved slightly back or forward, it will flip on the pitch axis, back or "
"forward, respectively. If the RC Pitch stick is neutral but the RC ROLL is "
"pushed slightly right, it will flip rolling to the right."
msgstr ""
"翻转方向默认为向左横滚（ROLL LEFT），但如果 RC 俯仰摇杆稍向后拉或前推，则会分别绕俯仰轴向后或向前翻转。如果 RC 俯仰摇杆居中而 RC "
"横滚摇杆稍向右推，则会向右横滚翻转。"

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:18 4352f082db554b7b8ce65c65c38880ab
msgid ""
"During the flip the throttle is managed to attempt to neither gain or lose "
"altitude. It is only an attempt!"
msgstr "翻转期间会对油门进行管理，力求既不增加也不损失高度。这仅仅是尽力尝试！"

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:19 9ce6491bf663484c820efd1ab921b5ba
msgid ""
"You may abort the flip by moving the pitch or roll stick as if to command "
"near full stick in that axis. The Flip will immediately halt **at whatever "
"attitude it is currently at** and return to the previous flight mode at the "
"pilot's throttle stick input."
msgstr ""
"将俯仰或横滚摇杆推向接近该轴满行程的位置即可中止翻转。翻转会立即 **在当前所处的姿态** 停止，并按飞手当前的油门摇杆输入返回之前的飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/flip-mode.rst:20 e5de562d057745359daab7d518def705
msgid ""
"As the flip is completing, it will briefly increase throttle to try to "
"recover any lost altitude. Again, this is an approximation. Once completed "
"(entry attitude re-attained), the previous flight mode is returned to (if "
"not entered by an AUX switch). It will not flip again until the Aux Switch "
"is lowered and raised again, if used, or FLIP flight mode re-entered. If "
"entered via a flight mode switch, you will need to change mode out of FLIP, "
"to another mode, and then back again if another flip is desired,"
msgstr ""
"翻转接近完成时，会短暂加大油门以尝试找回损失的高度。同样，这只是近似处理。完成后（重新回到进入时的姿态），将返回之前的飞行模式（若不是通过 AUX "
"开关进入）。若使用 Aux 开关，需将其拨低再拨高才能再次翻转；若通过飞行模式开关进入，想再次翻转则需先从 FLIP 切换到其他模式，再切回 FLIP。"

